# Baaki - Implementation Master Plan (Resume-Grade Backend Project)

> Goal: Build a production-grade expense sharing platform that demonstrates backend engineering skills expected by top product companies (Amazon, Microsoft, Google, Uber, Atlassian, Walmart, Salesforce, etc.) in the AI era.

---

# Vision

Baaki is **NOT** a Splitwise clone.

Baaki is a backend engineering showcase.

Every feature should exist because it demonstrates an engineering concept:

- scalability
- concurrency
- reliability
- performance
- security
- distributed systems
- production readiness

The objective is that an interviewer can spend **45-60 minutes** discussing this single project.

